Bundled third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sandfort has no third-party code dependencies. It does bundle public signing
keys published by Linux distributions, used to verify that a pinned image
checksum was signed by the distribution that published it. These are public
keys, reproduced unmodified, and are not covered by the Apache License above.

